a#user\"></use></svg><span>我的个人主页</span></a></section><section class=\"nav-group nav-group-account nav-group-collapsible\" data-collapse-key=\"account\"><button class=\"nav-label nav-label-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-tooltip=\"管理个人资料、主题与账号安全；运营后台仅对有权限的账号显示。\" aria-description=\"管理个人资料、主题与账号安全；运营后台仅对有权限的账号显示。\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"账户与设置，点击收起菜单\"><span>账户与设置</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg></button><a class=\"nav-item \" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html\" data-nav-key=\"settings\" data-tooltip=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\" aria-description=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#settings\"></use></svg><span>个人设置</span></a></section><div class=\"nav-scroll-fade-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></nav>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><div class=\"mini-membership\" data-settings-link-ready=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\" title=\"点击打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\"><div class=\"mini-avatar\" data-member-initial=\"\">何</div><div><span data-member-name=\"\">演示用户</span><small data-member-level=\"\">天使</small></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sidebar-resize-handle\" role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" title=\"拖动调整菜单宽度\"></div></aside>\n  <main class=\"workspace-main\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"topbar-left\"><button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg#menu\"></use></svg></button><div><span>READY FOR TODAY</span><div class=\"page-heading-row\"><h1>今日自动备稿</h1><p class=\"page-intro\" data-page-note=\"\">先挑一条适合你的稿子，再带到内容工作室继续修改。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button><a class=\"back-dashboard\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/main.html\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#home\"></use></svg><span>返回我的工作台</span></a></div></header>\n    <div class=\"settings-content sm-shell dp-shell\">\n      <section class=\"pm-hero\"><div><h2>好内容自动备好，好故事由你来讲</h2><p>结合你的商业定位和已有素材，准备选题与口播稿。挑一条有感觉的，带上自己的经历，接着改、接着拍。</p><ol class=\"sm-steps\"><li><b>01</b>看看今天的稿</li><li><b>02</b>挑一条像自己的</li><li><b>03</b>带到工作室继续做</li></ol></div></section>\n      <p id=\"dp-status\" class=\"pm-status is-error\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">当前暂未开通自动备稿。</p>\n      <div id=\"dp-app\">\n        <section class=\"dp-overview\" aria-label=\"备稿状态\"><div><strong id=\"dp-state\">开启后，每天少想一步</strong><p id=\"dp-schedule\" class=\"pm-muted\">先确认商业定位、备稿自动提醒时间和调用大模型每日费用阈值。</p><p id=\"dp-usage\" class=\"pm-muted\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></div><div class=\"dp-actions\"><button class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" id=\"dp-manual-now\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\">现在准备一条</button><button class=\"pm-btn\" id=\"dp-settings-open\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\">自动备稿设置</button><button class=\"pm-btn\" id=\"dp-control\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\">恢复自动备稿</button><a class=\"pm-btn\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/video-studio.html\">自己开始创作</a></div></section>\n        <p class=\"dp-note\">想在群里收到备稿提醒？<a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html#settings-bot-reminders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">设置飞书 / 企业微信机器人提醒 →</a></p>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\" id=\"dp-settings\" hidden=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"dp-settings-title\">\n          <header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"dp-settings-title\">把备稿时间交给你决定</h2><p>只需设置一次。每天凌晨01:00—05:00自动备稿，到你选择的时间在站内提供。</p></div></header>\n          <form id=\"dp-preferences\" class=\"sm-create-form\">\n            <p id=\"dp-draft-note\" class=\"dp-draft-note sm-wide\" hidden=\"\">已恢复你上次没保存的修改。<button type=\"button\" id=\"dp-draft-discard\">放弃这些修改</button></p>\n            <label class=\"pm-field\">每天几点提醒？<select id=\"dp-time\" required=\"\" data-min-minute=\"360\" data-max-minute=\"1320\" data-step-minute=\"60\"><option value=\"06:00\">06:00</option><option value=\"07:00\">07:00</option><option value=\"08:00\">08:00</option><option value=\"09:00\">09:00</option><option value=\"10:00\">10:00</option><option value=\"11:00\">11:00</option><option value=\"12:00\">12:00</option><option value=\"13:00\">13:00</option><option value=\"14:00\">14:00</option><option value=\"15:00\">15:00</option><option value=\"16:00\">16:00</option><option value=\"17:00\">17:00</option><option value=\"18:00\">18:00</option><option value=\"19:00\">19:00</option><option value=\"20:00\">20:00</option><option value=\"21:00\">21:00</option><option value=\"22:00\">22:00</option></select><small>北京时间06:00—22:00；修改后次日生效。</small></label>\n            <label class=\"pm-field\">短视频拍多长？<select id=\"dp-seconds\"><option value=\"60\">约1分钟</option><option value=\"90\" selected=\"\">约1分半</option><option value=\"120\">约2分钟</option><option value=\"180\">约3分钟</option><option value=\"240\">约4分钟</option><option value=\"300\">约5分钟</option></select></label>\n            <label class=\"pm-field sm-wide\">最近最想分享的方向（选填）<input id=\"dp-brief\" maxlength=\"2000\" placeholder=\"例如：我想帮刚开店的妈妈，用真实经历介绍自己的产品\"><small id=\"dp-portrait-hint\"></small></label>\n            <details class=\"sm-wide dp-details\" open=\"\"><summary>费用与新闻参考</summary><div class=\"sm-create-form dp-detail-body\">\n              <label class=\"pm-field\">每天允许的估算额度（元）<input id=\"dp-budget\" type=\"number\" min=\"0.01\" step=\"0.01\" required=\"\"><small>含自动写稿与换稿；实际收费以服务商账单为准。</small></label>\n              <label class=\"dp-check sm-wide\" id=\"dp-news-label\"><input id=\"dp-news\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>也参考近期新闻（另需开通）</span></label>\n              <label class=\"pm-field sm-wide\" id=\"dp-keywords-label\" hidden=\"\">公开的行业关键词<input id=\"dp-keywords\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"例如：家庭教育、亲子阅读\"><small>仅把这些词发给新闻服务，不发送你的商业定位。查询费用由平台承担。</small></label>\n              <label class=\"dp-check sm-wide\" id=\"dp-sharing-label\" hidden=\"\"><input id=\"dp-sharing\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>允许已获我模型账户授权的会员自动备稿（共享账户合计不超过我的每日估算额度）</span></label>\n            </div></details>\n            <div class=\"dp-note sm-wide\"><strong id=\"dp-model\"></strong><p id=\"dp-estimate\"></p><p>首次开启会马上开始备稿，计入今天的数量。连续72小时没有使用会员页面，自动暂停；回来后需要点击“恢复自动备稿”。自动备稿不保证阅读量或成交效果。</p></div>\n            <label class=\"dp-check sm-wide\"><input id=\"dp-consent\" type=\"checkbox\" required=\"\"><span>我同意使用上述账户自动备稿，已了解费用范围和暂停规则。更换模型账户后需重新确认。启用全文整理后，首次会分段阅读笔记，再把前后片段整理成完整故事；正文不变时复用结果。对依据明确但改写较大的句子，最多补一次事实核对。以上调用均产生费用，并计入每天授权额度。遇到可修正的问题，每条最多自动修改一次，也会产生调用费用，计入上述额度。</span></label>\n            <div class=\"dp-actions sm-wide\"><button class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" type=\"submit\" id=\"dp-save\">确认并开启自动备稿</button><a class=\"pm-btn\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html#settings-ai-api\">查看模型配置</a><a class=\"pm-btn\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/portrait.html\">查看商业定位</a></div>\n            <p id=\"dp-setting-status\" class=\"pm-status sm-wide\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n          </form>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"dp-list-title\">\n          <header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"dp-list-title\">给今天留一点创作的余地</h2><p>先读开头，再决定要不要用。采用前请确认经历、数据和观点符合实际。</p></div></header>\n          <details class=\"dp-details\"><summary>看看我最近用过哪些写法</summary><div id=\"dp-type-summary\"><p>最近还没有可分类的备稿记录。</p></div><p class=\"pm-muted\">按最近30天的备稿版本及写法大致归类；记录不代表播放、咨询或成交效果。</p></details>\n          <form id=\"dp-filter\" class=\"sm-list-toolbar\"><label class=\"pm-field\">查看范围<select id=\"dp-history\"><option value=\"false\">今天的稿</option><option value=\"true\">以前的稿</option></select></label><label class=\"pm-field\">状态<select id=\"dp-item-state\"><option value=\"all\">全部</option><option value=\"unused\">待使用</option><option value=\"adopted\">已加入创作</option><option value=\"hidden\">已隐藏</option></select></label><label class=\"pm-field\">找一条选题<input id=\"dp-search\" type=\"search\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"输入标题或正文关键词\"></label><button class=\"pm-btn\" type=\"submit\">搜索</button></form>\n          <p id=\"dp-action-note\" class=\"pm-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden=\"\"></p>\n          <div id=\"dp-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><nav id=\"dp-pagination\" class=\"sm-pagination\" aria-label=\"备稿记录翻页\"></nav>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <dialog class=\"pm-dialog\" id=\"dp-replace\" aria-labelledby=\"dp-replace-title\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"dp-replace-title\">让下一条更像你</h2><p>补一件真实的小事，或一句你认同、不同意的看法。</p></div><button class=\"pm-btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"dp-replace-close\" aria-label=\"关闭\">关闭</button></header><form id=\"dp-replace-form\"><label class=\"pm-field\">想补充什么？<textarea id=\"dp-material\" rows=\"5\" maxlength=\"2000\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"例如：今天客户说没时间拍视频，我告诉她，先说清一个真实问题，比追热点更重要。\"></textarea></label><p id=\"dp-replace-cost\" class=\"pm-muted\"></p><p class=\"pm-status\" id=\"dp-replace-status\" role=\"status\"></p><button class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" type=\"submit\">用这些素材换一条</button></form></dialog>\n\n\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-restore\" data-sidebar-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\" title=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button><div class=\"nav-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\"></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog\" data-global-search-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-search=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"global-search-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>GLOBAL SEARCH</span><h2 id=\"global-search-title\">全站搜索</h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-search=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭搜索\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <label class=\"global-search-field\">\n        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#spark\"></use></svg>\n        <input type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"搜索你感兴趣的任何内容吧\" aria-label=\"搜索关键词\">\n        <kbd>ESC</kbd>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"global-search-status\">输入关键词，快速找到可以继续使用的内容。</div>\n      <div class=\"global-search-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog daily-action-dialog\" data-daily-action-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-daily=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel daily-action-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"daily-action-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>DAILY CHECK-IN</span><h2 id=\"daily-action-title\">今日行动 <small class=\"daily-action-brand\">每日出摊</small></h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-daily=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭今日行动\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <p class=\"daily-action-hint\">辛苦一天不容易，赶紧记一笔，再小的成果也是进步。</p>\n      <form data-daily-action-form=\"\" class=\"daily-action-form\">\n        <fieldset>\n          <legend>行动类型 <em class=\"required\">必填</em></legend>\n          <div class=\"daily-action-options\">\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_moments\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了条朋友圈</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"xhs_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇小红书</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_channels_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了视频号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇公众号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_card\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发布了公众号贴图</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"short_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了短视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"long_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了长视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"qa_answer\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>问答平台答了题</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"client_followup\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>聊了老客户</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"self_media_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>自媒体平台发文</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"deal_closed\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>做了个成交</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"private_pool_growth\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>又加了私域</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"scroll_douyin\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>学习了抖音对标博主</span>\n    </label></div>\n        </fieldset>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动标题</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"选填 · 写下今天发出去的内容标题\" data-daily-title=\"\">\n          <small>带标题的记录会展示在 <a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/member-profile.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">你的会员主页</a>，点击可直接跳转查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动网址</span>\n          <input type=\"url\" name=\"url\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"选填 · 其他会员有权限点击查看\" data-daily-url=\"\">\n          <small>其他会员有权限点击查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <div class=\"daily-action-actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"secondary-action\" data-close-daily=\"\">取消</button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"meeting-primary\" data-daily-submit=\"\">记一笔今日行动</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-status\" data-daily-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      </form>\n    </section></div><a id=\"bottomBar\" style=\"position: fixed; bottom: -40px; left: 0px; z-index: 9999; transform: translateX(-50%); background-color: transparent; border-radius: 5px 5px 0px 0px; opacity: 0.3; padding: 5px; transition: 0.3s; cursor: pointer; max-height: 100px; max-width: 45px;\"><img src=\"chrome-extension://kobncfkmjelbefaoohoblamnbackjggk/icon/icon_32.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"></a></body><plasmo-csui id=\"aitdk-csui\"></plasmo-csui><div id=\"immersive-translate-popup\" style=\"all: initial\"></div></html>","controls":[{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"button","text":"隐藏菜单","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[["data-sidebar-collapse",""]]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"button","text":"看清业务","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[["data-tooltip","先把业务看清：我服务谁、解决什么问题，现在卡在哪，下一步往哪里走。"]]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"button","text":"日常工作","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[["data-tooltip","每天真正要做的事：让 AI 帮一把、跟进客户、整理会议、记下想法。"]]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"button","text":"学习提升","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[["data-tooltip","按基本功、进阶打法、真实案例和经营资源四个方向补能力。选一节适合当前问题的课，学完试着用到业务中。"]]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"button","text":"会员服务","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[["data-tooltip","权益、活动、积分与成长记录，都在这里查看和使用。"]]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"button","text":"账户与设置","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[["data-tooltip","管理个人资料、主题与账号安全；运营后台仅对有权限的账号显示。"]]},{"tag":"DIV","id":"","text":"何\n演示用户\n天使","attributes":[["data-settings-link-ready","1"]]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"button","text":"搜索\n⌘K","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[["data-open-search",""]]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"dp-manual-now","name":"","type":"button","text":"现在准备一条","value":"","disabled":true,"attributes":[]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"dp-settings-open","name":"","type":"button","text":"自动备稿设置","value":"","disabled":true,"attributes":[]},{"tag":"SUMMARY","id":"","text":"看看我最近用过哪些写法","attributes":[]},{"tag":"SELECT","id":"dp-history","name":"","type":"select-one","text":"今天的稿\n以前的稿","value":"false","disabled":false,"attributes":[]},{"tag":"SELECT","id":"dp-item-state","name":"","type":"select-one","text":"全部\n待使用\n已加入创作\n已隐藏","value":"all","disabled":false,"attributes":[]},{"tag":"INPUT","id":"dp-search","name":"","type":"search","text":"输入标题或正文关键词","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[]},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","name":"","type":"submit","text":"搜索","value":"","disabled":false,"attributes":[]}]}